        "notes": "MECHIEVAL is a top-down shooter game. Players will pilot mechs to battle infected creatures during the late medieval period plagued by the Black Death. In the game, players will use various weapons (machine guns, flamethrowers, grenade launchers, etc.) to eliminate multiple types of infected creatures. This process will feature scenes of gore and dismemberment. In certain levels, the environment will also be filled with bloodstains and severed limbs."
